Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:32:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1629/3799] soh: rename func_8096D5D4 ->
 DemoEc_MoveActorRebased

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the same move, but first rebases the skeleton's translation onto the current root joint so the actor does not jump when the animation is swapped.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Ec/z_demo_ec.c   | 45 ++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

